[14945]="70074663\n1\tSpeak with Mizâdi by the memorial cairn for Numûru\tJoin and speak with Mizâdi by the memorial cairn for Numûru.\n2\tPlace the memorial stones upon the cairn (total: 8)\tPlace the memorial stones you've collected on top of the existing stones.\n3\tSpeak with Mizâdi by the memorial cairn for Numûru\tSpeak with Mizâdi by the memorial cairn for Numûru.\n4\tPlace Numûru's sword in front of the memorial\030Place Numûru's armour in front of the memorial\tPlace Numûru's sword and armour in front of the memorial.\n5\tSpeak with Mizâdi by the memorial cairn for Numûru\tSpeak with Mizâdi by the memorial cairn for Numûru.\n6\tSpeak with Mizâdi by the memorial cairn for Numûru\tSpeak with Mizâdi by the memorial cairn for Numûru.\n7\tSpeak with Mizâdi by the memorial cairn for Numûru\tSpeak with Mizâdi by the memorial cairn for Numûru.\n8\tPay your respects to Numûru, and the other fallen Subuzûri\tPay your respects to Numûru, and the other fallen Subuzûri.\n9\tSpeak with Mizâdi by the memorial cairn for Numûru\tSpeak with Mizâdi by the memorial cairn for Numûru.\n10\tSpeak with Mizâdi by the memorial cairn for Numûru\tSpeak with Mizâdi by the memorial cairn for Numûru.\n11\tSpeak with Mizâdi by the memorial cairn for Numûru\tSpeak with Mizâdi by the memorial cairn for Numûru.\n12\tSpeak with Mizâdi by the memorial cairn for Numûru\tSpeak with Mizâdi by the memorial cairn for Numûru.\n13\tSpeak with Mizâdi by the memorial cairn for Numûru\tSpeak with Mizâdi by the memorial cairn for Numûru.\n14\tSpeak once more with Mizâdi by the memorial cairn for Numûru\tSpeak once more with Mizâdi by the memorial cairn for Numûru.\n",
[14946]="70074664\n1\tSpeak with Numûru in Ingarûma\tSpeak with Numûru in Ingarûma. Ingarûma is located south of Hanamíku, high on a hill-top overlooking Imizíla.\n2\tCollect polishing oil from serpents (total: 6)\030Collect sharpening whetstones north of Ingarûma (total: 8)\tCollect whetstones and defeat Hatokáli serpents and strikers to collect their oils, to polish and repair Subuzûri armour.\n3\tSpeak with Numûru in Ingarûma\tSpeak with Numûru in Ingarûma. Ingarûma is located south of Hanamíku, high on a hill-top overlooking Imizíla.\n",
[14947]="70074665\n1\tJoin Mizâdi, Rahâzi, and Razâl's conversation\tJoin Mizâdi, Rahâzi, and Razâl's conversation inside Mizâdi's tent.\n2\tListen to Mizâdi and Rahâzi's conversation\tListen to Mizâdi and Rahâzi's conversation.\n3\tGrab the map from the pile of scrolls\tGrab the map from the pile of scrolls in the corner of the tent.\n4\tPlace the map on the table in front of Mizâdi\tPlace the map on the table in front of Mizâdi and Rahâzi.\n5\tListen to the conversation between Mizâdi, Razâl, and Rahâzi\tListen to the conversation between Mizâdi, Razâl, and Rahâzi.\n6\tListen to the conversation between Mizâdi, Razâl, and Rahâzi\tListen to the conversation between Mizâdi, Razâl, and Rahâzi.\n7\tSpeak with Shâra Mizâdi inside the tent\tSpeak with Shâra Mizâdi inside the tent.\n",
[14948]="70074666\n1\tSpeak with Shâra Mizâdi in Hanamíku\tSpeak with Shâra Mizâdi in Hanamíku.\n2\tGo to the outskirts of Bolo Thúki, the Ordâkhai encampment\tGo to the outskirts of the Ordâkhai camp near Hanamíku, Bolo Thúki. Bolo Thúki can be found south-east of Hanamíku.\n3\tDefeat the Boxer in Bolo Thúki\030Defeat the Dragon in Bolo Thúki\tDefeat the Boxer and the Dragon in Bolo Thúki, and convince one or both to return to Hanamíku.\n4\tSpeak with Shâra Mizâdi in Hanamíku\tSpeak with Shâra Mizâdi in Hanamíku. Hanamíku can be found in Pahar Hatokáli, which is south of Idagâl, within Mûr Ghala.\n",
[14949]="70074667\n1\tSpeak with Shâra Mizâdi within Imizíla\tSpeak with Shâra Mizâdi within Imizíla.\n2\tDefeat Ordâkhai & destroy barricades within Imizíla\tDefeat Ordâkhai and destroy barricades within Imizíla to force out the remaining Ordâkhai.\n3\tDefeat Ordâkhai within Imizíla (total: 15)\030Destroy Ordâkhai barricades within Imizíla (total: 6)\tDefeat Ordâkhai and destroy barricades within Imizíla to force out the remaining Ordâkhai.\n4\tDefeat Ordâkhai bóra & rally faltering Subuzûri in Imizíla\tRally faltering Subuzûri within Imizíla and defeat the remaining Ordâkhai bóra.\n5\tDefeat Ordâkhai bóra in Imizíla (total: 3)\030Rally faltering Subuzûri in Imizíla (total: 5)\tRally faltering Subuzûri within Imizíla and defeat the remaining Ordâkhai bóra.\n6\tFind and speak with Shâra Mizâdi in Imizíla\tFind and speak with Shâra Mizâdi in Imizíla.\n7\tFind and speak with Shâra Mizâdi in Imizíla\tFind and speak with Shâra Mizâdi in Imizíla.\n8\tSpeak with Razâl in Imizíla\tSpeak with Razâl in Imizíla.\n9\tSpeak with Shâra Mizâdi in Imizíla\tSpeak with Shâra Mizâdi in Imizíla.\n",
[14950]="70074668\n1\tSpeak with Razâl in Hanamíku\tSpeak with Razâl in Hanamíku about scouting Bârshud and a forward camp to the south.\n2\tScout Roz Káskrauz for signs of Bârshud\tRazâl has asked you to scout various points south of Hanamíku to get the lay of the land and figure out where Bârshud may be. The first location is Roz Káskrauz, high up in the hills.\n3\tScout outside Imizíla for signs of Bârshud\tRazâl has asked you to scout various points south of Hanamíku to get the lay of the land and figure out where Bârshud may be. Next is Imizíla, where Razâl suspects Bârshud to be. Imizíla is below Roz Káskrauz, to the south.\n4\tScout Ingarûma for camp suitability\tRazâl has asked you to scout various points south of Hanamíku to get the lay of the land. Finally he asked you to scout Ingarûma as the potential site of a forward camp for Mizâdi's forces.\n5\tFight off the marauding brigands (total: 5)\tYou are beset by brigands! Fight them off!\n6\tSpeak with Razâl in Hanamíku\tSpeak with Razâl in Hanamíku. Hanamíku can be found in Pahar Hatokáli, within Mûr Ghala.\n7\tSpeak with Shâra Mizâdi in Hanamíku\tSpeak with Shâra Mizâdi in Hanamíku.\n",
[14951]="70074669\n1\tEnter Ingarûma\tEnter Ingarûma and make your way inside the camp.\n2\tDefeat brigands within Ingarûma (total: 12)\030Destroy hastily constructed barricades (total: 6)\tDefeat brigands within Ingarûma and destroy their hastily constructed fortifications.\n3\tFind and defeat the brigand chief Zalûd within Ingarûma\tFind and defeat the brigand chief Zalûd within Ingarûma.\n4\tFind and defeat the brigand chief Zalûd within Ingarûma\tFind and defeat the brigand chief Zalûd within Ingarûma.\n5\tBuild new camp-fires in Ingarûma (total: 4)\030Construct new tents in Ingarûma (total: 3)\tBuild new camp-fires and construct new tents in Ingarûma.\n6\tPlant Mizadi's banner at the highest point in Ingarûma\tPlant Mizadi's banner at the highest point in Ingarûma to signal to the others that it is now safe to arrive.\n",
[14952]="7007466A\n1\tMove forward into Bârshud's fortress\tMove forward into Bârshud's fortress.\n2\tDefeat Bârshud's guards (total: 8)\tKill Bârshud's guards within Imizíla. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n3\tMove forward to confront Bârshud in his throne room\tMove forward to confront Bârshud in his throne room.\n4\tListen to the conversation in Bârshud's throne room\tListen to the conversation in Bârshud's throne room.\n5\tDefeat the risen Numûru\tDefeat the risen Numûru within Bârshud's fortress in Imizíla. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n6\tListen to Mizâdi and Bârshud's conversation\tListen to Mizâdi and Bârshud's conversation.\n7\tListen to Mizâdi and Bârshud's conversation\tListen to Mizâdi and Bârshud's conversation.\n8\tSpeak with Shâra Mizâdi about what to do next\tSpeak with Shâra Mizâdi about what to do next.\n9\tListen to Mizâdi and Rahâzi's conversation\tListen to Mizâdi and Rahâzi's conversation.\n10\tListen to Mizâdi and Rahâzi's conversation\tListen to Mizâdi and Rahâzi's conversation.\n",
[14953]="7007466B\n1\tSpeak with Khórpon Bóro in Hanamíku\tSpeak with Khórpon Bóro in Hanamíku. He can be found near the courtyard with vines within Hanamíku.\n2\tSpeak with Shâra Mizâdi in Hanamíku\tSpeak with Shâra Mizâdi in Hanamíku.\n3\tSpeak with Khórpon Bóro in Hanamíku\tSpeak with Khórpon Bóro in Hanamíku.\n4\tSeek out a tool-maker in Hanamíku\tSeek out a tool-maker in Hanamíku. You may find one near the markets.\n5\tMine ore for Unagâr west of Hanamíku (total: 6)\tGather iron from deposits in the hills west of Hanamíku.\n6\tSpeak with Unagâr, the tool-maker in Hanamíku\tSpeak with Unagâr, the tool-maker in Hanamíku.\n7\tDefeat wasps outside of Unagâr's house (total: 9)\tDefeat wasps near Unagâr's home near the road, west of Hanamíku.\n8\tSpeak with Unagâr the tool-maker in Hanamíku\tSpeak once more with Unagâr the tool-maker in Hanamíku.\n9\tPresent the key to Shâra Mizâdi in Hanamíku\tPresent the key to Shâra Mizâdi in Hanamíku. Hanamíku can be found in Pahar Hatokáli, within Mûr Ghala.\n",
